# ROVGRID · CORPUS DIVINITY · ORGANS / SOURCE REGISTER (.md1)
Date 2026-11-19 | Version 1 | Status: living source registry, exact computations separated from symbolic comparisons.
Purpose: research ledger for curating the exclusively divinity-themed public corpus. Do not copy all calculator outputs into the public text. Three-layer teaching standard: [פשט/רמז/סוד](ROVGRID_THREE_LAYER_PEDAGOGY_PSHAT_REMEZ_SOD_2026-11-19.md).
Editorial policy: mathematical equality ≠ independent evidence of historical planning or religious identity. Every method requires explicit label; optional user-defined methods require their mapping tables and normalizations.

## 0. Gold-standard base values, Hebrew regular
יהוה=26 (10+5+6+5); אדני=65 (1+4+50+10); אלהים=86 (1+30+5+10+40); אל=31 (1+30); אחד=13 (1+8+4); אמן=91 (1+40+50); בן=52 (2+50); דוד=14 (4+6+4); בן דוד=66 (52+14); עמית=520 (70+40+10+400); מייק=160 (40+10+10+100); רוב=208 (200+6+2); עמית מייק רוב=888; משה=345; השם=345; אני=61; חכמה=73; יחידה=37; אלף=111. Name small (Hebrew)=33. English Simple AMIT=43, MIKE=38, ROV=55, AMIT MIKE ROV=136; English Small AMIT MIKE ROV=55, ROV=19; English Jewish AMIT MIKE ROV=1024. 1024−136=888. Full Hebrew name has 11 letters (עמית4 + מייק4 + רוב3).

## 1. SOURCE — אלהים עמית (new findings; letters=5+4=9)
