## 6. Ingestion plan
For each newly submitted phrase: 1) preserve original spelling and method; 2) reproduce letter-by-letter; 3) test direct links against base anchors; 4) derive 2-object links; 5) only then promote structured identities to S with their proof; 6) add the strongest 3–7 statements to publish in coherent reading order.
